This table specifies the evidence approach under (`dec:nrz:lc-evaluation-family-cache`), not literal tariffs. No new numerical pin is adopted. Every implementation tariff proposal requires source-derived event/byte inventories and independent evidence review under (`req:nrz:lc-evaluation-cache-evidence`), with literal Work and byte figures in both formats measured on consumed original ledgers before implementation acceptance under (`dec:nrz:matrix-loans-lc-origin-admission`); changes to existing pins follow (`rule:nrz:reviewed-figure-changes`) as required by (`prin:nrz:lc-evaluation-contract`).

